# Ghost Quarter's {T}, Sacrifice this land destroys target land, and that land's controller (Bot2) may then search for a
# basic land and put it onto the battlefield untapped. Bot2 accepts and fetches a Forest from the library.

[Bot1 Deck]
Ghost Quarter
Island x17

[Bot2 Deck]
Island
Island
Island
Island
Island
Island
Island
Island
Forest
Island x9

[Actions]
